  <item>
    <title>08-请问，你为什么不出去旅游？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65bf75d235dd8780ed7fdf37</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65bf75d235dd8780ed7fdf37</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 04 Feb 2024 11:32:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：@滚滚菌Jun，@偶尔开飞机的贝塔，@闪闪Shaan</span></p><span></span><p><span>哈喽大家好！这里是屿陆电波的第08期节目！</span></p><span></span><p><span>闪闪作为三位主播中I人成分最高的一位，突然有了长假却不出去玩，因此被另外两位批评……</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目凸显了三位主播的巨大差异，不知道各位听友更倾向于谁呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果喜欢本节目的话，欢迎大家订阅支持哦！</span></p><span></span><h2><span>========== 时间轴 ==========</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 片头~~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="35">00:35</a> 屿陆电波，启动！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="88">01:28</a> 闪闪：不想出去玩儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="203">03:23</a> 滚滚：你们对旅游的预期是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="454">07:34</a> 贝塔：理解闪闪，但不支持</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1000">16:40</a> 滚滚：你的旅行一定要带着目的吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1322">22:02</a> 贝塔：我喜欢柳暗花明又一村的感觉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1817">30:17</a> 滚滚：北京故宫，大排长龙，可以不去；西藏寺庙，高原反应，一定要去！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2276">37:56</a> 贝塔：不晕船能比别人多看风景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2581">43:01</a> 闪闪：为了感受当地人的生活，特意坐公交车</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2819">46:59</a> 贝塔：在内蒙古的草原上蹦迪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3319">55:19</a> 闪闪：学会某些东西，比经历某些事情，更让我快乐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3604">01:00:04</a> 破案了，因为闪闪是处女座！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3766">01:02:46</a> 贝塔：旅游将自己从工作中解脱出来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3921">01:05:21</a> 滚滚：旅游的意义是自己定义的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4277">01:11:17</a> 所有人：明年的旅游规划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4494">01:14:54</a> 贝塔：我要去仙本那！已经定了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5177">01:26:17</a> 第七期，结束！</span></p>]]></description>
