  <item>
    <title>05-圣诞特辑：一起来唱歌吧！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65884040b8fd2bc060fb49f0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65884040b8fd2bc060fb49f0</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 24 Dec 2023 14:29:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：@滚滚菌Jun，@偶尔开飞机的贝塔，@闪闪Shaan</span></p><span></span><p><span>哈喽大家好！欢迎点开我们的节目！这里是屿陆电波的第05期节目！BTW，这期有好听的背景乐哦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>冬至、圣诞双节来临，又恰逢考研人考试，这注定是个不平凡的一周……</span></p><span></span><p><span>第05期节目是一期特辑，我们将进行有趣的念歌词猜歌名游戏，当然，为了增加难度，我们还会真声献唱！！而且还要计分哦~</span></p><span></span><p><span>歌曲分高中低三个难度，三个人每个人在各个难度阶梯出5首歌。所以，来享受45首歌的听觉盛宴吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>不知道大家是否也有一起哼唱起来呢？如果喜欢的话，欢迎大家订阅哦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>========== 时间轴 ==========</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 屿陆电波，启动！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="46">00:46</a> 关于圣诞的印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="305">05:05</a> 圣诞节，收获满满的苹果吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="520">08:40</a> 特辑-猜歌名游戏正式开始！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="549">09:09</a> 猜歌名游戏规则介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="635">10:35</a> 正式开始-闪闪-简单组5首歌组</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1413">23:33</a> 贝塔-简单组5首歌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1896">31:36</a> 滚滚-简单组5首歌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2275">37:55</a> 上难度！闪闪-中等组5首歌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2860">47:40</a> 贝塔-中等组5首歌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3720">01:02:00</a> 闪闪、贝塔合体，深情对唱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3832">01:03:52</a> 滚滚-中等组5首歌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4650">01:17:30</a> 终极难度-闪闪-困难组5首歌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4771">01:19:31</a>圣诞歌曲出现了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5780">01:36:20</a> 贝塔-困难组5首</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6715">01:51:55</a> 闪闪听过这首歌乐队的现场~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6764">01:52:44</a> 滚滚-困难组5首歌。进入决赛圈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7700">02:08:20</a> 分数公开，最后的结果竟然是这样？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7748">02:09:08</a> 分享我们的游戏体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7904">02:11:44</a> 第五期，结束！</span></p>]]></description>
