  <item>
    <title>04-婚育观大逆转！我经历了什么？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/657d17b7cab6086ec1ea8567</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">657d17b7cab6086ec1ea8567</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 16 Dec 2023 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：@滚滚菌Jun，@偶尔开飞机的贝塔，@闪闪Shaan</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：CC</span></p><span></span><p><span>哈喽大家好！欢迎点开我们的节目！这里是屿陆电波的第04期节目！</span></p><span></span><p><span>对“婚育观”的讨论是近几年比较流行的话题，越来越多的青年不再将婚育作为人生必须的事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们的嘉宾CC——是的，我们请嘉宾了！（鼓掌）——之前也是抱着这种观念，由此和主播们产生了强烈的共鸣和激烈的碰撞！</span></p><span></span><p><span>究竟！是什么改变了TA“不婚不育”的观念，反而过上了婚后生活，并且很幸福呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目是我们第一次请嘉宾来作客，不知道大家感觉怎么样呢？如果喜欢的话，欢迎大家订阅哦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>========== 时间轴 ==========</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 屿陆电波，启动！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="14">00:14</a> 嘉宾CC出现！她的身份是？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="121">02:01</a> 滚滚听说的诈骗故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="622">10:22</a> 进入正题：婚姻观和生育观大不相同，为何能走到一起？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="677">11:17</a> 以前的贝塔：怎么可以不！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="804">13:24</a> 当时的CC：我为什么非要？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="987">16:27</a> 以前的闪闪：理解但不支持</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1079">17:59</a> 贝塔：这是一种动物本能</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1186">19:46</a>未婚男士闪闪：向往家庭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1236">20:36</a> 已婚男士贝塔：更注重另一半的想法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1417">23:37</a> 提问CC：你的这种想法来自于哪里？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1641">27:21</a> CC：对象的可靠是衡量是否生育的一个重要指标</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1763">29:23</a> 滚滚相亲遇到的两类奇葩男性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1942">32:22</a> 女士震怒！直男踩雷！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2171">36:11</a> 贝塔：责任感来自于原生家庭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2253">37:33</a> 踩雷后两个人沟通过吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2424">40:24</a> 男性对女性的一种误解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2636">43:56</a> CC：突然觉得孩子变得可爱起来了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2804">46:44</a> 未婚男士闪闪的畅想：我想深度参与到孩子的成长中去</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2907">48:27</a> 已婚男士贝塔的科学育儿理念：恒河猴实验与依恋关系实验&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3371">56:11</a> 已婚女士CC的育儿观：让孩子有自己的想法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3585">59:45</a> CC：父母的支持非常重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3847">01:04:07</a> 第四期，结束！</span></p>]]></description>
